    "abstract": "Parts breakdown of the forward primary distribution centre contactor installation, showing the original and the latching module standards as alternates at the same item numbers, together with the interface bracket used at the outboard positions.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "Illustrated parts breakdown of the contactor module installation in the forward primary distribution centre, covering the original standard and the latching standard as alternate items.",
      "figure_note": "The figure is drawn looking forward at the rack front face with the cover removed. Sheet 1 shows the three primary positions and sheet 2 shows the interface bracket detail at the outboard positions only. Items 10 and 10A are alternates and either may be fitted at a primary position, because a mixed rack is possible on an aircraft part way through conversion. The interface bracket at item 40 is fitted at the outboard positions only and does not appear at the inboard position."
